WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.241
- You do this thing where you
start typing and then stop.

00:00:03.241 --> 00:00:08.006
(laid-back music)

00:00:08.006 --> 00:00:11.294
- You strike me as the type of
person who never texts first

00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:12.838
and that's just not gonna work for me.

00:00:12.838 --> 00:00:14.001
- You always text first.

00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:15.024
It's exhausting.

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:15.956
(laughs)

00:00:15.956 --> 00:00:17.134
- You wake up how early?

00:00:17.134 --> 00:00:20.887
- Yeah, I love sleeping
in way too much for that.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.336
- I took a glance at your Netflix account.

00:00:23.336 --> 00:00:25.809
Unfortunately, we don't
like any of the same shows.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:27.436
- "The Princess Bride" is overrated?

00:00:27.436 --> 00:00:28.979
Oh, so you're some kind of a monster.

00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:31.023
- I'm not saying I don't want to date you

00:00:31.023 --> 00:00:33.067
because you used the
wrong "your" in a text,

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.776
but that is definitely
what's happening here.

00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:37.112
- A grammar Nazi, how charming.

00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:38.989
- The amount of meat
you eat makes me worried

00:00:38.989 --> 00:00:40.366
you're going to die before me.

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:41.616
- A vegan?

00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:43.703
I don't know if I'm ready
to be that open-minded.

00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:46.246
- We have a lot of mutual
friends on Facebook.

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:48.582
This strikes me as a high-risk situation.

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:49.624
- Oh my god, your mom

00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:52.071
just Facebook friended me way too soon.

00:00:52.071 --> 00:00:55.172
- Wow, you post a lot of
political articles on Facebook.

00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:56.882
I don't know how I feel about that.

00:00:56.882 --> 00:01:00.386
- The number of hours you spend
on your phone is terrifying.

00:01:00.386 --> 00:01:03.452
- It horrifies me that you
don't know what Instagram is.

00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:06.016
- You literally say the
word "literally" a lot.

00:01:06.016 --> 00:01:09.717
- Oh, you have a selfie stick.

00:01:09.717 --> 00:01:10.656
That just happened.

00:01:10.656 --> 00:01:12.231
- You Googled me?

00:01:12.231 --> 00:01:13.732
Ah, that is so creepy.

00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:15.150
- A music snob?

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.068
That's fine 'cause I'll always love

00:01:17.068 --> 00:01:18.779
Britney Spears more than you.

00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:20.573
- You know this ain't ever gonna work,

00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:22.454
but we can still make out.

